      "section": "monthly_output",
      "item_en": "GS UK CAI, GS-MAP, GS Surprise Index, and official GS FCI",
      "item_zh": "GS UK CAI、GS-MAP、GS Surprise Index与官方GS FCI",
      "status_en": "Proprietary GS products. This page charts public components only, including ONS monthly GDP MoM, industrial/services output YoY, and retail-sales YoY/MoM derived from official level series.",
      "status_zh": "GS专有产品；本页只绘制公开可复跑组成项，包括由官方水平序列派生的ONS月度GDP环比、工业/服务产出同比，以及零售销售同比/环比。"
    },
    {
      "section": "monthly_output",
      "item_en": "Manufacturing, construction, services, and composite PMI",
      "item_zh": "制造业、建筑业、服务业与综合PMI",
      "status_en": "Important in the GS framework, but not yet wired because S&P Global PMI history is vendor-controlled.",
      "status_zh": "在GS框架中很重要，但S&P Global PMI历史数据受供应商控制，暂未接入。"
